r-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["649b88e8-36eb-535a-9d7d-c616e3706841" "612eaedc-bb65-5c1d-9229-3394e9e42ac1"] :answer-field/correct "612eaedc-bb65-5c1d-9229-3394e9e42ac1" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "cea6932b-4af3-5566-9df5-ff31732c88bd" :question/id #uuid "cea6932b-4af3-5566-9df5-ff31732c88bd" :question/problem "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{3}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{3}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n- **I.** $AB=BA={I}_{2}$\n- **II.** $AC=CA={I}_{2}$\n- **III.** $B={A}^{-1}$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "- First, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{3}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & -3 \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is false. As a result, $B\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement III is false too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{3}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{3}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["7c803419-9276-5165-ad10-b381828948dd" "7bf2a116-d332-5fa5-ad24-fee13aeeef9b" "ac68011a-f137-563c-8e51-d7912bc0cadd"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "e4092b17-5e2b-5dae-8d40-155034ad4c5c" :answer/id #uuid "e4092b17-5e2b-5dae-8d40-155034ad4c5c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "af7d221a-e506-58c2-b708-2dc6e0aecacc" :answer/id #uuid "af7d221a-e506-58c2-b708-2dc6e0aecacc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "3583ba2a-bb42-5b1a-b10d-98b42a330396" :answer-field/id #uuid "3583ba2a-bb42-5b1a-b10d-98b42a330396" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["e4092b17-5e2b-5dae-8d40-155034ad4c5c" "af7d221a-e506-58c2-b708-2dc6e0aecacc"] :answer-field/correct "af7d221a-e506-58c2-b708-2dc6e0aecacc" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "c064270a-45b0-5d37-a64c-f9bd3cd9b591" :answer/id #uuid "c064270a-45b0-5d37-a64c-f9bd3cd9b591" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "fc515591-2d15-5fb3-814a-53134068b49e" :answer/id #uuid "fc515591-2d15-5fb3-814a-53134068b49e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "30ed5c96-6ee0-5f39-93b3-2c433c407047" :answer-field/id #uuid "30ed5c96-6ee0-5f39-93b3-2c433c407047" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["c064270a-45b0-5d37-a64c-f9bd3cd9b591" "fc515591-2d15-5fb3-814a-53134068b49e"] :answer-field/correct "fc515591-2d15-5fb3-814a-53134068b49e" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "c58b7fa5-e8fb-56df-8329-c2b7be0a6bab" :answer/id #uuid "c58b7fa5-e8fb-56df-8329-c2b7be0a6bab" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "56893b98-2738-501f-917d-58a00ce969f4" :answer/id #uuid "56893b98-2738-501f-