e too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $DE=ED={I}_{2}.$ Computing $DE$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}DE & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{4} & -\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["70d7643b-6104-537f-a2f7-ea56fddc6fea" "6ee91bd2-1a95-558f-be1a-abb6d916f84b" "eb7d7075-905e-5751-8aff-80da43bf5d97"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "bd898e4d-5a1c-5b90-9026-8badc38ea15a" :answer/id #uuid "bd898e4d-5a1c-5b90-9026-8badc38ea15a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "af6e0e43-fe72-533d-8ce8-b52921a85d3e" :answer/id #uuid "af6e0e43-fe72-533d-8ce8-b52921a85d3e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5b8c5578-01e3-5343-9d4f-ceab9a95811c" :answer-field/id #uuid "5b8c5578-01e3-5343-9d4f-ceab9a95811c" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["bd898e4d-5a1c-5b90-9026-8badc38ea15a" "af6e0e43-fe72-533d-8ce8-b52921a85d3e"] :answer-field/correct "af6e0e43-fe72-533d-8ce8-b52921a85d3e" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "c4677bc8-584e-5a37-8e85-d19023d4fd41" :answer/id #uuid "c4677bc8-584e-5a37-8e85-d19023d4fd41" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9fd317b7-c798-5691-b1ba-0c74608dec81" :answer/id #uuid "9fd317b7-c798-5691-b1ba-0c74608dec81" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "7f089b2b-28ab-5800-9e30-9367b30f8877" :answer-field/id #uuid "7f089b2b-28ab-5800-9e30-9367b30f8877" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["c4677bc8