ix}-2 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is true.\n\n- Now, we check whether $EG=GE={I}_{2}.$ Computing $EG$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}EG & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{3}{4} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & ∗ \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false. As a result, $G\\ne {E}^{-1}$ and statement III is false too.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["5b8c5578-01e3-5343-9d4f-ceab9a95811c" "7f089b2b-28ab-5800-9e30-9367b30f8877" "e1e6cee0-56d4-5f73-a00c-baa130261c3e"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "16f19bf8-5330-5aec-a447-97d784a2f670" :answer/id #uuid "16f19bf8-5330-5aec-a447-97d784a2f670" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "8ad1cbe5-05ab-50d4-a52f-2752023f71df" :answer/id #uuid "8ad1cbe5-05ab-50d4-a52f-2752023f71df" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ec8284a8-0bf3-544a-9c54-cec969c7eca3" :answer-field/id #uuid "ec8284a8-0bf3-544a-9c54-cec969c7eca3" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["16f19bf8-5330-5aec-a447-97d784a2f670" "8ad1cbe5-05ab-50d4-a52f-2752023f71df"] :answer-field/correct "16f19bf8-5330-5aec-a447-97d784a2f670" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "58cf03af-8176-5bb0-b78f-02e392065bcc" :answer/id #uuid "58cf03af-8176-5bb0-b78f-02e392065bcc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ae2bfeeb-8629-57aa-9218-a109b80f97f7" :answer/id #uuid "ae2bfeeb-8629-57aa-9218-a109b80f97f7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/i