n{bmatrix}∗ & ∗ \\\\ -1 & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is false.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{4} & -\\frac{1}{4}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{4} & -\\frac{1}{4}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is true. As a result, $C={A}^{-1}$ and statement III is true too.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["ec8284a8-0bf3-544a-9c54-cec969c7eca3" "13d4c9e5-cfb7-5da5-a46f-651c8e8beaf2" "c8de493c-224a-5509-ba23-047e3c23f50d"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "bf82865b-b7f8-5978-a65d-6ceaeecc7985" :answer/id #uuid "bf82865b-b7f8-5978-a65d-6ceaeecc7985" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d2c67902-8586-522d-8128-26d6372edb3c" :answer/id #uuid "d2c67902-8586-522d-8128-26d6372edb3c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "352475c6-893f-5d15-8bd4-4fc7d65c9b40" :answer-field/id #uuid "352475c6-893f-5d15-8bd4-4fc7d65c9b40" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["bf82865b-b7f8-5978-a65d-6ceaeecc7985" "d2c67902-8586-522d-8128-26d6372edb3c"] :answer-field/correct "d2c67902-8586-522d-8128-26d6372edb3c" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "e8f869e2-c759-591a-9c02-906bc98f760f" :answer/id #uuid "e8f869e2-c759-591a-9c02-906bc98f760f" :answer/type :answer.t