/worked-solution "- First, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ -1 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{3}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is false. As a result, $B\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement III is false too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ -1 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{3}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{3}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ -1 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["352475c6-893f-5d15-8bd4-4fc7d65c9b40" "5aac40eb-e4b1-5a40-92f2-d09ca0cd77c3" "765fa93c-fc92-5c91-8fc2-7219896e12df"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "e59853dc-024a-5613-8bda-a7a5ad6a4077" :answer/id #uuid "e59853dc-024a-5613-8bda-a7a5ad6a4077" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "539f2745-380c-5c87-9c4b-698d2d8a5ae1" :answer/id #uuid "539f2745-380c-5c87-9c4b-698d2d8a5ae1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d9e9e3af-3b8c-5fe9-9bf6-926f2aefd6ba" :answer-field/id #uuid "d9e9e3af-3b8c-5fe9-9bf6-926f2aefd6ba" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type :answer-fie